  <text>
    <body>
      <p>Charles Nettleton, photographer, is listed in <ref target="civic?id=Madeline%20Street">Madeline Street</ref> in the Sands &amp; McDougall directories from 1865 to 1885, mostly at No. 19 (Nos 19 and 21 in 1879 and 1880). From 1867 to 1874 he is also listed under <ref target="civic?id=Victoria%20Street">Victoria Street</ref>, so his studio was probably near the corner.</p>
      <p>In 1895 the directories list Chas. Nettleton, photographer, at 225 <ref target="civic?id=Berkley%20Street">Berkley Street</ref>.</p>
    </body>
  </text>
